# Trivy image-scan exceptions (Jenkinsfile stage 8) - trivy runs from the repo root, so this
# file applies to both the backend and frontend scans in one place.
#
# Every entry below was verified against Maven Central/upstream on the date noted: the fix
# version Trivy's vulnerability DB reports does not exist in any published repository yet, so
